700
00:31:37,833 --> 00:31:39,292
Kemenangan besar buat kita.

701
00:31:39,375 --> 00:31:41,750
Terus kita yakinin mereka,
tau gak apa yang beneran seksi?

702
00:31:41,833 --> 00:31:42,883
Perut buncit ala bapak-bapak.

703
00:31:43,542 --> 00:31:44,875
Bercanda ya? Kita lagi hoki nih.

704
00:31:44,958 --> 00:31:46,500
Rasanya kayak dapet
untung gede tanpa modal.

705
00:31:46,583 --> 00:31:48,833
Apalagi ya—
Apa lagi yang bisa kita akalin?

706
00:31:48,917 --> 00:31:50,958
Tau gak apa yang keren banget?
Jadi orang miskin.

707
00:32:08,458 --> 00:32:10,167
-Dia nyuri jokes-ku.
-Kamu gak bisa ambil—

708
00:32:10,250 --> 00:32:11,375
-[ALEX] Halo. Selamat pagi. Hai.
-Dia bahkan gak butuh itu.

709
00:32:11,458 --> 00:32:12,333
-Hei. Hai.
-Hei.

