719
00:32:25,042 --> 00:32:26,250
-Alex.
-Yuk jalan. Ada di depan.

720
00:32:26,333 --> 00:32:27,708
-Ayo, ayo, ayo. Sini liat.
-Bentar! Kami lagi sarapan nih.

721
00:32:27,792 --> 00:32:29,250
[ALEX] Ayo, cepetan.

722
00:32:30,917 --> 00:32:32,500
-Ini keren banget.
-Lihat itu!

723
00:32:32,583 --> 00:32:34,292
Oh, tunggu, tunggu.

724
00:32:34,375 --> 00:32:35,375
-[TESS] Hei! Tunggu sebentar!
-[FELIX] Wah, keren banget.

725
00:32:35,458 --> 00:32:36,458
-Bentar. Ayah panggil ibumu dulu.
-Wah. Ini keren.

726
00:32:36,542 --> 00:32:39,292
