872
00:37:55,042 --> 00:37:56,792
-[NADA PIANO BERLANJUT]
-[TESS] <i>Under Pressure</i>?

873
00:37:57,875 --> 00:37:59,750
Oh. Itu lagu itu ya.

874
00:37:59,833 --> 00:38:00,958
[TERTAWA]

875
00:38:01,042 --> 00:38:02,333
[TESS] [TERTAWA]
Kamu gak ngenalin lagunya?

876
00:38:02,417 --> 00:38:04,792
Enggak. Padahal udah dengar
40 juta kali, tetep gak ngenalin.

877
00:38:04,875 --> 00:38:06,333
Mereka terobsesi banget.

878
00:38:06,958 --> 00:38:08,083
Cuma itu yang mereka bahas.

879
00:38:08,167 --> 00:38:09,750
Padahal penampilannya masih lama banget.

880
00:38:09,833 --> 00:38:11,875
Aku heran mereka dapet
etos kerja kayak gitu dari mana.

881
00:38:11,958 --> 00:38:13,542
[TESS] Mm. Kasihan mereka.

882
00:38:14,583 --> 00:38:16,417
Coba periksa sekali lagi di sini.

883
00:38:16,500 --> 00:38:20,417
[NADA PIANO <i>UNDER PRESSURE</i>
TERUS BERMAIN]

884
00:38:20,500 --> 00:38:25,083
Aku mau coba-coba masuk ke
dunia kepelatihan lagi.

885
00:38:27,333 --> 00:38:28,917
Itu alasanmu ke kota tadi?

886
00:38:29,875 --> 00:38:32,083
Gak. Aku ke kota karena kamu telepon.

887
00:38:33,417 --> 00:38:35,333
Oh. Aku cuma ngira
kamu emang lagi di kota,

888
00:38:35,417 --> 00:38:37,083
soalnya kamu bilang bakal langsung dateng.

889
00:38:37,167 --> 00:38:39,250
Iya. Aku pengen liat rumah singgah tempat…

890
00:38:39,333 --> 00:38:41,042
anak-anak kita tinggal paruh waktu.

891
00:38:41,125 --> 00:38:42,500
[ALEX] Aku seneng kamu paham
suasana yang aku incer.

892
00:38:42,583 --> 00:38:44,083
Iya, kamu keren kok.

893
00:38:44,833 --> 00:38:47,833
Aku belum hubungin program mana pun, cuma…

894
00:38:47,917 --> 00:38:50,750
[NADA PIANO "UNDER PRESSURE"
TERUS BERMAIN]

895
00:38:50,833 --> 00:38:52,083
[ALEX] Menurutku itu bagus.

896
00:38:52,167 --> 00:38:54,000
Program mana pun pasti pengen
rekrut kamu, aku yakin itu.

897
00:38:54,583 --> 00:38:56,417
Iya.

898
00:38:56,500 --> 00:38:57,583
Aku juga mikir gitu.

899
00:39:00,250 --> 00:39:02,375
Um, kayaknya kamu aman.

900
00:39:03,417 --> 00:39:05,000
Bagus deh. Oke.

901
00:39:06,208 --> 00:39:07,458
Kamu mau mandi bareng—

902
00:39:07,542 --> 00:39:10,000
dan bilas pake sampo khusus itu?

903
00:39:10,083 --> 00:39:11,125
[TESS] Oh, oh…

904
00:39:11,208 --> 00:39:12,100
-Boleh juga.
-Iya.

905
00:39:12,183 --> 00:39:13,292
Iya, iya, iya.

906
00:39:13,375 --> 00:39:15,125
Kamar mandinya lurus ke sana sebelah kiri.

907
00:39:15,208 --> 00:39:17,125
[NADA PIANO BERLANJUT]

908
00:39:30,542 --> 00:39:35,042
[NAPAS TERENGHAP PELAN]

909
00:39:38,583 --> 00:39:40,958
[MENGHEMBUSKAN NAPAS]

910
00:39:46,083 --> 00:39:49,875
[TERENGHAP-ENGHAP]

911
00:39:49,958 --> 00:39:53,458
[SUARA GADUH TIDAK JELAS]

912
00:40:01,083 --> 00:40:02,458
[MENDESAH] Kamu pasti bisa.

913
00:40:04,208 --> 00:40:05,500
[KOMIKA PRIA] Jadi aku baca kalau

914
00:40:05,583 --> 00:40:06,875
fantasi nomor satu…

915
00:40:06,958 --> 00:40:07,883
-[PENJAGA] Ada yang bisa dibantu?
-Hei, Bung.

916
00:40:07,967 --> 00:40:09,167
Iya, aku mau ikut open mic.

917
00:40:09,250 --> 00:40:10,875
Iya, di sini. Tulis aja namamu di situ.

918
00:40:10,958 --> 00:40:11,833
Oke.

919
00:40:11,917 --> 00:40:13,042
Kamu giliran berikutnya.

920
00:40:13,125 --> 00:40:14,250
-Aku berikutnya?
-Yo, siap-siap ya.

921
00:40:15,083 --> 00:40:16,208
Sial.

922
00:40:16,292 --> 00:40:17,333
Lampunya udah nyala, jadi aku harus turun.

923
00:40:17,417 --> 00:40:18,500
Oh, lampunya. Lampunya.

924
00:40:18,583 --> 00:40:19,958
Lampunya. Iya, lampunya.

925
00:40:20,042 --> 00:40:22,000
[TEPUK TANGAN TERPENCAR]

926
00:40:22,083 --> 00:40:26,042
[PERCAKAPAN TIDAK JELAS]

927
00:40:26,125 --> 00:40:27,375
[PRIA TERTAWA]

928
00:40:33,375 --> 00:40:35,167
[PRIA] Bapak-bapak dan Ibu-ibu…
[BICARA TIDAK JELAS]

929
00:40:38,500 --> 00:40:39,875
-[PENJAGA 2] <i>Yo, Bung. Apa kabar?</i>
-[ALEX] <i>Hei.</i>

930
00:40:39,958 --> 00:40:41,125
Sebenernya aku berharap bisa cuma,

931
00:40:41,208 --> 00:40:42,417
tau lah,
nonton dan nongkrong aja malam ini?

932
00:40:42,500 --> 00:40:45,000
-Boleh.
-Bisa? Aku ada 15 dolar nih.

933
00:40:45,083 --> 00:40:47,792
Gak usah. Simpen aja duitmu.
Beliin sesuatu yang bagus sana.

934
00:40:47,875 --> 00:40:49,375
-Masuk aja.
-Makasih, Bung.

935
00:40:49,458 --> 00:40:52,083
Sama-sama— Cuma… Iya, habisin
dulu itu sebelum kamu masuk.

936
00:40:53,125 --> 00:40:54,458
-Habisin?
-Iya.

937
00:40:54,542 --> 00:40:55,375
[ORANG-ORANG TERKEKEH]

938
00:40:55,458 --> 00:40:57,833
-Hei.
-Hei.

939
00:40:57,917 --> 00:40:58,958
-[JILL] Ini dia orangnya.
-Cari posisi yang nyaman ya.

940
00:40:59,542 --> 00:41:01,042
Aku boleh duduk di sini?

941
00:41:01,125 --> 00:41:02,958
-Boleh. Gak ada yang duduk kok.
-[JILL] Santai aja.

942
00:41:03,042 --> 00:41:04,458
Gimana malammu?

943
00:41:04,542 --> 00:41:06,250
Layanlah, cukup oke.

944
00:41:06,333 --> 00:41:09,167
Tadi aku ke tempat open mic lain dan…

945
00:41:09,250 --> 00:41:11,250
[TAWA TERPENCAR]

946
00:41:11,333 --> 00:41:12,750
Iya.

947
00:41:12,833 --> 00:41:14,208
Tau gak, aku udah
ngelakuin ini selama 25 tahun.

948
00:41:14,292 --> 00:41:15,500
Paham kan maksudku? Dan aku suka.

949
00:41:15,583 --> 00:41:16,958
Aku gak mau ada di tempat lain.

950
00:41:17,042 --> 00:41:19,000
Tapi yang aku suka darimu
adalah kamu polos banget.

951
00:41:19,083 --> 00:41:20,167
Bukan lugu, tapi polos.

952
00:41:20,250 --> 00:41:21,500
Dan itulah kenapa itu berhasil.

953
00:41:21,583 --> 00:41:23,083
Jadi itu bagus. Keluar dari kepalamu,

954
00:41:23,167 --> 00:41:24,417
kamu tulis di kertas, terus naik panggung.

955
00:41:24,500 --> 00:41:26,500
Udah kayak terapi.
Tapi, orang bisa ngerasa relate.

956
00:41:26,583 --> 00:41:27,792
-[ALEX] Aku gak tau itu apa.
-Kamu emang gak tau apa-apa.

957
00:41:27,875 --> 00:41:29,375
Tapi aku cuma tau kalau dateng ke sini…

958
00:41:29,458 --> 00:41:32,000
-akhirnya bikin aku ngerasa…
-[KEMP] Iya. Ini tempat yang aman.

959
00:41:32,083 --> 00:41:33,042
-[ALEX] Yah, jauh lebih baik.
-[KEMP] Iya.

960
00:41:34,042 --> 00:41:34,958
Kamu keren— maksudku, kamu
payah soal stand-up,

961
00:41:35,042 --> 00:41:36,375
tapi kamu orang baik.

962
00:41:36,458 --> 00:41:39,000
Kamu punya hati yang tulus.
Kamu kelihatan murni…

963
00:41:39,083 --> 00:41:40,833
kayak aku percaya sama kamu
kalau kamu baru nemuin hal ini,

964
00:41:40,917 --> 00:41:43,000
dan sekarang kamu jatuh cinta
sama dunia stand-up.

965
00:41:43,083 --> 00:41:45,458
Selain fakta kalau aku
ngerasa terhina, makasih ya.

966
00:41:45,542 --> 00:41:47,958
Tapi kamu emang payah. Payah banget malah.

967
00:41:48,042 --> 00:41:49,208
-[KEMP TERTAWA]
-[TERKEKEH] Oke deh.

968
00:41:49,292 --> 00:41:50,750
[JILL] Jadi aku waxing.
Gak sakit sih, ya kan?

969
00:41:50,833 --> 00:41:52,417
Terus mbaknya ngerjainnya cepet banget,

970
00:41:52,500 --> 00:41:54,000
sampai aku gak tau apa yang terjadi.

971
00:41:54,083 --> 00:41:57,250
Terus dia bilang,
"Segitiganya sudah jadi." Oke.

972
00:41:57,333 --> 00:41:59,250
-"Segitiganya sudah jadi."
-[TAWA PENONTON]

973
00:41:59,333 --> 00:42:00,500
Hasil yang dia kasih…

974
00:42:00,583 --> 00:42:02,417
Oke, bentar. Boleh pinjam serbetnya?

975
00:42:03,875 --> 00:42:06,500
Yang aku harepin tuh gini.

976
00:42:06,583 --> 00:42:09,125
Ini yang aku bayangin. Oke?

977
00:42:09,208 --> 00:42:12,000
Kalian lihat ini? Masuk akal. Wajar lah.

978
00:42:12,083 --> 00:42:14,375
-[TAWA PENONTON]
-[TERNAPAS] Yang dia kasih…

979
00:42:14,458 --> 00:42:15,458
[MENGEJEK]

980
00:42:15,542 --> 00:42:17,375
[TAWA PENONTON]

981
00:42:22,083 --> 00:42:23,167
…tuh kayak gini.

982
00:42:24,083 --> 00:42:26,500
-Ini konyol— Lihat deh.
-[WANITA] Gak mungkin!

983
00:42:26,583 --> 00:42:28,208
-[TAWA PENONTON]
-Lihat apa yang aku kasih unjuk.

984
00:42:28,292 --> 00:42:31,166
Aku gak— Ini bukan— Kecil banget.

985
00:42:31,250 --> 00:42:33,250
Yah, aku bawa minumku ke atas. Um…

986
00:42:33,958 --> 00:42:35,458
-[PRIA] Gak apa-apa.
-Boleh kan?

987
00:42:35,542 --> 00:42:37,250
Bentar. Kalian keberatan gak?
Aku taruh sini ya.

988
00:42:37,333 --> 00:42:38,875
[PRIA] Pake aja!

989
00:42:38,958 --> 00:42:41,375
Kamu oke? Aku jagain kok,
oke? Jadi, jangan—

990
00:42:41,458 --> 00:42:43,292
Duh, tolong bius aku dong.

991
00:42:43,375 --> 00:42:44,792
-[TAWA PENONTON]
-Oh.

992
00:42:44,875 --> 00:42:46,917
Tolong, aku pengen banget
dibius malam ini.

993
00:42:47,000 --> 00:42:49,208
-[TEPUK TANGAN]
-Tolong ya!

994
00:42:49,292 --> 00:42:52,375
Hey, beneran kamu main sulap? Itu beneran?

995
00:42:52,458 --> 00:42:54,500
Iya. Itu kerjaan utamaku.

996
00:42:54,583 --> 00:42:57,000
Salah satu anakku,
dia terobsesi banget sama sulap.

997
00:42:57,083 --> 00:42:58,500
-Oh, ya?
-Iya, dia mau ulang tahun,

998
00:42:58,583 --> 00:42:59,875
dan ibunya lagi siapin acara,

999
00:42:59,958 --> 00:43:01,167
aku mau kasih tambahan sesuatu di sana.

1000
00:43:01,250 --> 00:43:03,792
Kamu mau gak ngisi acara kayak gitu? Apa…?

1001
00:43:03,875 --> 00:43:05,333
-Uh, iya. Bisa, bisa.
-Ya?

1002
00:43:05,417 --> 00:43:06,500
-Aku mau kok. Tentu.
-Oke.

1003
00:43:06,583 --> 00:43:08,250
[GAGANG PINTU BERKLIK]

1004
00:43:12,917 --> 00:43:14,083
[ALEX [PELAN]] Parkir di depan gapura oke?

1005
00:43:16,250 --> 00:43:18,917
Oke kok di depan gapura.
Mereka gak bakal ke mana-mana.

1006
00:43:29,125 --> 00:43:30,542
Sial, ini warnanya bahkan gak emas.

1007
00:43:32,167 --> 00:43:33,375
Harusnya aku pilih balonnya aja.

1008
00:43:37,167 --> 00:43:39,292
-Apa?
-[GONGGONGAN ANJING]

1009
00:43:39,375 --> 00:43:40,833
-Hei!
-Hei. Hei.

1010
00:43:40,917 --> 00:43:41,958
Lagi ngapain di luar?
Pintunya kebuka tadi.

1011
00:43:42,042 --> 00:43:44,000
-Aku gak tau protokolnya gimana.
-Apaan sih? Masuk sini.

1012
00:43:44,083 --> 00:43:46,167
-Kalian baik-baik aja?
-[MUSIK RITMIS BERMAIN]

1013
00:43:46,250 --> 00:43:47,500
-Wah.
-[ANAK-ANAK BERGUMAM]

1014
00:43:47,583 --> 00:43:49,125
-Bakal seru banget nih.
-Kamu beneran totalitas ya.

1015
00:43:49,208 --> 00:43:51,417
Hei, bisa bantu aku keluarin makanan lagi?

1016
00:43:52,167 --> 00:43:53,792
Ada camilan sayur di kulkas.

1017
00:43:53,875 --> 00:43:55,208
-Ada dua piring.
-Oke.

1018
00:43:55,292 --> 00:43:57,167
[TESS] Aku beneran butuh wortelnya

1019
00:43:57,250 --> 00:43:58,917
soalnya mereka
sama sekali gak nyentuh sayur.

1020
00:43:59,000 --> 00:44:02,125
Hai, jagoan. Oh, hei. Hai, hai.
Lagi seneng ya?

1021
00:44:02,208 --> 00:44:03,333
-[FELIX] Iya.
-Ya? Gimana pesulapnya?

1022
00:44:03,417 --> 00:44:04,583
-[FELIX] Bagus.
-Ya?

1023
00:44:05,083 --> 00:44:07,125
Ayahmu minta maaf gak bisa dateng.

1024
00:44:07,208 --> 00:44:09,167
-Dia lagi jalan-jalan santai.
-Oke.

1025
00:44:09,250 --> 00:44:11,917
[BALLS] Hei! Itu dia.

1026
00:44:13,292 --> 00:44:14,917
[ALEX] Hei, Charlie gak suka
kalo diangkat gitu.

1027
00:44:15,583 --> 00:44:17,000
Itu namanya?

1028
00:44:17,083 --> 00:44:18,000
Iya. Kamu beneran gak tau nama Charlie?

1029
00:44:18,083 --> 00:44:19,333
Enggak. [TERKEKEH]

1030
00:44:19,417 --> 00:44:21,083
-Setelah sekian lama?
-Bung, kamu kelihatan seger banget.

1031
00:44:21,167 --> 00:44:22,292
-Beneran?
-Iya, iya.

1032
00:44:22,375 --> 00:44:24,000
Kamu kelihatan— Berat badanmu turun ya?

1033
00:44:24,083 --> 00:44:25,292
Itu sweter baru?

1034
00:44:25,375 --> 00:44:27,750
Jujur, enggak, aku udah punya sweter ini…

1035
00:44:27,833 --> 00:44:29,167
Yah, kamu harus pake itu terus.

1036
00:44:29,250 --> 00:44:30,917
Itu rasa bersalah yang
mulai menggerogotimu, aku yakin.

1037
00:44:31,000 --> 00:44:32,167
-[BALLS] Rasa bersalah?
-Christine.

1038
00:44:32,250 --> 00:44:33,250
-Apa?
-Jangan ngomong gitu.

1039
00:44:33,333 --> 00:44:34,958
Apa?

1040
00:44:35,042 --> 00:44:36,833
Rasa bersalah soal apa? Ngomongin
apa sih kamu, Christine?

1041
00:44:36,917 --> 00:44:38,125
[BALLS] Itu namamu kan?

1042
00:44:38,208 --> 00:44:40,042
Christine, apa aku lakuin
sesuatu yang nyinggung kamu?

1043
00:44:40,125 --> 00:44:42,500
Kalo emang iya, atau bikin kamu
kesel, aku beneran—

1044
00:44:42,583 --> 00:44:43,958
Gak, gak, gak. Tau gak? Lupain aja.

1045
00:44:44,042 --> 00:44:45,167
Aku gak jadi ke Oyster Bay.

1046
00:44:45,250 --> 00:44:46,142
[CHRISTINE]
Gak usah minta maaf ke aku. Apa?

1047
00:44:46,225 --> 00:44:47,125
-Teman-teman.
-[BALLS] Kenapa gak jadi?

1048
00:44:47,208 --> 00:44:48,375
-Ini acara ulang tahun lho.
-Ya pokoknya gitu.

1049
00:44:48,458 --> 00:44:49,917
[CHRISTINE] Ayo! Lari, lari, lari!

1050
00:44:50,000 --> 00:44:51,333
[ALEX] Ayo Judey, ayo Judey, ayo Jude!

1051
00:44:53,250 --> 00:44:55,000
Oh, dia dapet… Dia dapet punyaku…

1052
00:44:55,083 --> 00:44:56,833
Kamu bakal jadi bagian dari trik ini, oke?

1053
00:44:56,917 --> 00:44:58,000
-Sip.
-Boleh kami bertiga ikut?

1054
00:44:58,083 --> 00:44:59,167
-Boleh.
-Iya,

1055
00:44:59,250 --> 00:45:01,125
kalian bertiga boleh ikut. Oke.

1056
00:45:01,208 --> 00:45:03,500
-Kayaknya aku minum kebanyakan.
-[CHRISTINE] Sayang. Oh.

1057
00:45:03,583 --> 00:45:05,167
[MUSIK TERUS BERMAIN]

1058
00:45:05,250 --> 00:45:07,417
Aku gak… Aku gak sadar
tadi lagi gendong anjing.

1059
00:45:08,500 --> 00:45:10,125
Yah, ini lumayan oke lah.

1060
00:45:11,417 --> 00:45:13,917
[TESS] Bukan gara-gara aku kan
kamu gak jadi ke Oyster Bay?

1061
00:45:15,250 --> 00:45:16,458
Duh, bukan. Sama sekali bukan.

1062
00:45:16,542 --> 00:45:18,083
Maksudku, kita kan bisa pergi bareng.

1063
00:45:18,167 --> 00:45:19,792
Gak perlu jadi canggung kan? Ya kan?

1064
00:45:19,875 --> 00:45:22,792
-Gak… maksudmu kayak sekarang ini?
-[TESS] [TERKEKEH]

1065
00:45:22,875 --> 00:45:25,542
Hei, maaf soal aku yang agak emosi tadi.

1066
00:45:25,625 --> 00:45:26,500
Aku ngerasa diserang banget
sama orang-orang itu.

1067
00:45:26,583 --> 00:45:28,233
Iya.

1068
00:45:28,317 --> 00:45:29,208
Maksudku, ngapain juga kita
bahas Oyster Bay sekarang?

1069
00:45:29,292 --> 00:45:31,167
-Aku tau.
-Acaranya masih lama banget.

1070
00:45:31,250 --> 00:45:32,542
-[MENGEJEK] Mereka emang gila.
-Orang-orang itu,

1071
00:45:32,625 --> 00:45:33,875
kamu tau kan mereka psikopat
kalau soal bikin rencana.

1072
00:45:33,958 --> 00:45:35,958
-[TERKEKEH] Iya bener.
-[MENDESAH]

1073
00:45:36,042 --> 00:45:38,458
Yang aku tau, kita udah
berhasil besarin dua anak hebat.

1074
00:45:38,542 --> 00:45:40,083
-[ANAK-ANAK BERGUMAM]
-Ya kan?

1075
00:45:40,583 --> 00:45:41,875
Iya.

1076
00:45:41,958 --> 00:45:43,917
[SORAK-SORAI]

1077
00:45:44,000 --> 00:45:49,208
[SEMUA] <i>♪ Happy birthday, dear Jude ♪</i>

1078
00:45:49,292 --> 00:45:54,167
<i>♪ Happy birthday to you ♪</i>

1079
00:45:54,250 --> 00:45:55,208
-[MENARIK NAPAS]
-[SUARA DRUM ROLL]

1080
00:45:55,292 --> 00:46:00,000
[SORAK-SORAI]

1081
00:46:00,083 --> 00:46:03,375
-[MEMUKUL DRUM]
-[SORAK-SORAI]

1082
00:46:08,333 --> 00:46:09,833
[TABUHAN DRUM BERLANJUT]

1083
00:46:09,917 --> 00:46:12,833
[BERSORAK]

1084
00:46:12,917 --> 00:46:14,667
[ANAK-ANAK BERTERIAK SENANG]

1085
00:46:14,750 --> 00:46:16,292
[TABUHAN DRUM BERLANJUT]

1086
00:46:16,375 --> 00:46:18,417
-[BERHENTI]
-[TERTAWA]

1087
00:46:19,083 --> 00:46:21,375
[BERSORAK]

1088
00:46:23,083 --> 00:46:26,792
-[TABUHAN DRUM BERLANJUT]
-[ANAK-ANAK BERTERIAK]

1089
00:46:26,875 --> 00:46:28,292
[TABUHAN DRUM]

1090
00:46:28,375 --> 00:46:31,000
[ALEX TERTAWA]

1091
00:46:31,083 --> 00:46:34,083
-[TABUHAN DRUM]
-[BERTERIAK]

1092
00:46:34,167 --> 00:46:36,125
[TERTAWA]

1093
00:46:38,083 --> 00:46:40,375
[TABUHAN DRUM BERLANJUT]

1094
00:46:41,375 --> 00:46:43,125
-[TERTAWA]
-[MEMEKIK]

1095
00:46:43,208 --> 00:46:46,417
-Badanmu kena semua tuh.
-Aku tau! [TERTAWA] Aku—

1096
00:46:46,500 --> 00:46:48,458
Badanmu juga kena semua tuh.

1097
00:46:49,125 --> 00:46:51,292
[BALLS] Apa hubungannya hal itu
sama, kayak, buka botol wine?

1098
00:46:51,375 --> 00:46:53,208
-Hai.
-Hai.

1099
00:46:53,292 --> 00:46:54,833
-[ALEX] Makasih banyak ya udah dateng.
-[NINA] Makasih banyak udah undang aku.

1100
00:46:54,917 --> 00:46:56,417
Penampilanmu tadi keren.

1101
00:46:56,500 --> 00:46:57,458
-Iya, aku beneran hargai itu.
-Anak-anak suka banget.

1102
00:46:57,542 --> 00:46:58,500
-Hei, tadi itu luar biasa.
-Makasih. Makasih.

1103
00:46:58,583 --> 00:46:59,542
Oh. Keseimbanganku lagi gak pas.

1104
00:46:59,625 --> 00:47:00,875
-Salam kenal ya.
-Kamu oke?

1105
00:47:00,958 --> 00:47:01,333
-Ini sohibku.
-Salam kenal.

1106
00:47:01,417 --> 00:47:02,333
Balls.

1107
00:47:02,417 --> 00:47:03,875
-Balls?
-Iya.

1108
00:47:03,958 --> 00:47:05,333
Keren. Oke deh.

1109
00:47:05,417 --> 00:47:06,333
Selalu aja kejadian tiap saat.

1110
00:47:06,417 --> 00:47:07,500
Jangan suruh ibuku lakuin itu.

1111
00:47:09,125 --> 00:47:11,250
-Apa yang kejadian tiap saat?
-Enggak ada.

1112
00:47:11,333 --> 00:47:12,458
[BERBISIK] Oke, ada apa sebenernya?

1113
00:47:14,250 --> 00:47:15,833
Maksudmu soal
kenapa kamu masih pelihara jenggot itu

1114
00:47:15,917 --> 00:47:17,042
padahal panggung sandiwaranya
udah kelar dua bulan lalu?

1115
00:47:17,125 --> 00:47:18,833
Aku gak bisa milih kapan
karakter itu pergi dari jiwaku.

1116
00:47:18,917 --> 00:47:20,125
[ALEX] Karakter-karakter, maksudmu.

1117
00:47:20,208 --> 00:47:22,333
Sebenernya, aku ngerasa ini

1118
00:47:22,417 --> 00:47:24,292
malah ngasih hal baru,
buat para direktur casting,

1119
00:47:24,375 --> 00:47:26,167
sekarang aku kerja lagi.
Ngomong-ngomong makasih udah dateng.

1120
00:47:26,250 --> 00:47:27,875
Dua kali. Aku dateng dua kali.

1121
00:47:27,958 --> 00:47:29,292
Dan kamu bahkan gak tampil di kali kedua.

1122
00:47:29,375 --> 00:47:31,000
Aku tau.

1123
00:47:31,083 --> 00:47:34,500
Gara-gara si brengsek Paul itu
bilang dia bakal izin sakit

1124
00:47:34,583 --> 00:47:36,000
tapi ternyata dia tetep dateng.

1125
00:47:36,083 --> 00:47:38,833
Tapi aku seneng karena
dia bikin Santo Paul sakit,

1126
00:47:38,917 --> 00:47:40,083
dan aku tampil gantiin dia
selama dua minggu berturut-turut.

1127
00:47:40,167 --> 00:47:41,833
-Rasanya luar biasa.
-Iya, itu bonus namanya.

1128
00:47:41,917 --> 00:47:43,292
Dan orang-orang bilang
kalau aku itu, kayak…

1129
00:47:43,375 --> 00:47:44,875
-Iya.
-lebih bagus.

1130
00:47:44,958 --> 00:47:46,000
-Daripada dia?
-Iya.

1131
00:47:46,083 --> 00:47:47,167
Iya. Aku yakin itu.

1132
00:47:47,250 --> 00:47:48,875
-Aku sampai dikenalin orang di jalan.
-Masa?

1133
00:47:48,958 --> 00:47:50,917
Ada orang yang beneran ngira
aku salah satu murid Yesus. Keren kan.

1134
00:47:51,000 --> 00:47:53,250
Tapi kayaknya mereka itu,
kayak, fanatik agama gitu sih. Tapi…

1135
00:47:53,917 --> 00:47:55,292
Mereka bukan fans pertunjukannya ya?

1136
00:47:55,375 --> 00:47:57,042
Yah, mereka sering nonton kok.

1137
00:47:57,125 --> 00:48:00,333
Kayaknya mereka nonton hampir
selama dua minggu pas aku tampil.

1138
00:48:00,417 --> 00:48:02,583
Jadi, aku gak bilang ke mereka
kalau aku cuma pemeran pengganti.

1139
00:48:02,667 --> 00:48:04,167
-Tapi ya sudahlah, ini kan soal kamu.
-Bener.

1140
00:48:04,250 --> 00:48:07,292
Jangan… Jangan coba-coba
alihin pembicaraan.

1141
00:48:09,417 --> 00:48:10,375
Biar aku tanya ulang ya.

1142
00:48:11,583 --> 00:48:13,333
Ada apa sebenernya, Bung?

1143
00:48:14,417 --> 00:48:16,292
Ya, aku gak tau harus
bilang apa, Bung. Gak ada apa-apa.

1144
00:48:16,958 --> 00:48:18,083
Oke.

1145
00:48:18,625 --> 00:48:19,958
Kamu gak mau kasih tau namanya?

1146
00:48:20,917 --> 00:48:22,083
[MENDESAH]

1147
00:48:22,167 --> 00:48:23,000
Ya udah deh.

1148
00:48:23,583 --> 00:48:25,292
[BERDEHEM]

1149
00:48:25,375 --> 00:48:26,458
Kalau aku kasih tau sesuatu, kamu
janji gak bakal bilang siapa-siapa?

1150
00:48:26,542 --> 00:48:28,125
Enggak janji. Buruan kasih tau.
Siapa namanya?

1151
00:48:29,083 --> 00:48:30,000
[PERCAKAPAN TIDAK JELAS]

1152
00:48:30,083 --> 00:48:31,375
Aku lagi nyoba main stand-up.

1153
00:48:32,042 --> 00:48:33,167
Oh.

1154
00:48:33,250 --> 00:48:34,458
Aku gak kenal siapa itu.

1155
00:48:34,542 --> 00:48:36,167
Nama panggungnya aneh banget.
Apa? Dia terkenal?

1156
00:48:36,250 --> 00:48:37,792
Gak, gak, gak. Bung,

1157
00:48:37,875 --> 00:48:40,125
maksudku aku lagi main komedi tunggal
di panggung daerah kota.

1158
00:48:40,208 --> 00:48:41,083
Oke.

1159
00:48:42,250 --> 00:48:43,375
Apa?

1160
00:48:43,458 --> 00:48:44,500
Itu semacam hobi?

1161
00:48:46,250 --> 00:48:48,417
Yah, aku gak bakal langsung
keluar kerjaan dan tur keliling sih.

1162
00:48:48,500 --> 00:48:49,375
Oke.

1163
00:48:52,083 --> 00:48:54,125
Iya. Intinya, aku— aku suka banget, Bung.

1164
00:48:54,208 --> 00:48:57,000
Seru. Aku— Tau gak,
sebenernya ini luar biasa banget.

1165
00:48:57,083 --> 00:48:59,958
Emang nakutin, tapi aku suka
setiap aspek di dalamnya,

1166
00:49:00,042 --> 00:49:01,875
dan ini jadi sesuatu
yang aku tunggu-tunggu.

1167
00:49:01,958 --> 00:49:03,083
-Sialan.
-Kenapa?

1168
00:49:06,375 --> 00:49:08,375
[MENDESAH]

1169
00:49:08,458 --> 00:49:09,292
Aku udah curiga.

1170
00:49:10,917 --> 00:49:11,883
Curiga soal apa?

1171
00:49:13,208 --> 00:49:15,375
[TERKEKEH] Kayak…

1172
00:49:18,417 --> 00:49:21,042
Dari dulu kamu selalu jadi orang
paling lucu di mana pun, kan?

1173
00:49:21,125 --> 00:49:22,458
Sejak zaman kuliah,

1174
00:49:22,542 --> 00:49:24,000
dan sekarang pas kamu
bener-bener nekunin itu…

1175
00:49:24,083 --> 00:49:25,250
Aku gak lagi nekunin apa-apa.

1176
00:49:25,333 --> 00:49:27,083
Kamu bakal sukses gede. Itu udah pasti.

1177
00:49:27,875 --> 00:49:32,583
Dan rasanya sakit banget karena
aku benci fakta kalau aku…

1178
00:49:33,208 --> 00:49:34,833
[BERDEHEM] selalu ngerasa tenang…

1179
00:49:34,917 --> 00:49:36,000
karena tau kalau kamu itu
orangnya "nerimo".

1180
00:49:36,083 --> 00:49:37,375
Kalau kamu orang yang jalan di tempat.

1181
00:49:39,083 --> 00:49:41,875
Sedangkan aku ini tipe cowok yang…

1182
00:49:43,375 --> 00:49:45,833
yah, ambisius. Itulah gayaku.

1183
00:49:45,917 --> 00:49:47,417
Astaga, Balls.

1184
00:49:47,500 --> 00:49:49,500
Aku tau. Berat banget buatku
nyimpen perasaan ini sendirian.

1185
00:49:49,583 --> 00:49:51,208
Biar gak ada yang salah paham ya,

1186
00:49:51,292 --> 00:49:52,500
aku gak punya pacar.

1187
00:49:52,583 --> 00:49:54,250
-Oh, terserah kamu mau ngapain.
-Beneran enggak punya.

1188
00:49:54,333 --> 00:49:55,333
Dengar, itu gak penting.

1189
00:49:55,417 --> 00:49:56,542
Kamu gak perlu membela diri.

1190
00:49:56,625 --> 00:49:58,167
Lagian kamu udah terkenal sekarang.
Jadi, ya sudahlah.

1191
00:49:58,250 --> 00:49:59,417
Ngomong apaan sih kamu, Bung?

1192
00:49:59,500 --> 00:50:00,958
Dengar, kamu gak perlu kasih penjelasan.

1193
00:50:01,042 --> 00:50:02,333
Dengerin aku. Ke siapa pun.

1194
00:50:02,417 --> 00:50:04,000
Gak ke Tess, gak ke siapa pun.

1195
00:50:04,083 --> 00:50:06,833
Sama kayak Tess yang gak perlu
kasih penjelasan apa-apa ke kamu.

1196
00:50:07,542 --> 00:50:08,500
Penjelasan soal apa?

1197
00:50:10,958 --> 00:50:12,333
Bukan apa-apa.

1198
00:50:12,417 --> 00:50:14,917
-Apa Tess lagi deket sama orang?
-Enggak.

1199
00:50:15,000 --> 00:50:16,125
Maksudku, apa dia lagi buka hati?

1200
00:50:16,208 --> 00:50:17,167
Aku gak tau. Kayaknya sih enggak.

1201
00:50:17,250 --> 00:50:19,292
Tapi apa mungkin? Ya… bisa jadi.

1202
00:50:20,250 --> 00:50:21,333
Apa Christine ngomong sesuatu?

1203
00:50:21,417 --> 00:50:22,500
Siapa?

1204
00:50:22,583 --> 00:50:23,500
Christine?

1205
00:50:24,458 --> 00:50:25,500
So-Soal apa?

1206
00:50:25,583 --> 00:50:27,000
Soal Tess lagi deket sama orang.

1207
00:50:27,083 --> 00:50:28,417
Gak tuh. Emang dia bilang gitu?

1208
00:50:28,500 --> 00:50:29,500
Kan aku nanya kamu.

1209
00:50:31,375 --> 00:50:32,833
-Apa-apaan sih—
-Yah, emang kamu denger sesuatu?

1210
00:50:32,917 --> 00:50:34,000
Christine bilang apa soal itu?

1211
00:50:34,083 --> 00:50:35,833
Dia bilang apa?

1212
00:50:35,917 --> 00:50:37,125
Bung, kan aku nanya kamu.

1213
00:50:41,875 --> 00:50:44,208
Hei, Olga? Aku baru aja
naruh tumpukan sampah di sana.

1214
00:50:44,292 --> 00:50:46,000
-Ada lagi yang lain?
-Enggak. Udah semua. Makasih ya.

1215
00:50:46,083 --> 00:50:47,833
Bagus. Oke. Makasih.

1216
00:50:49,167 --> 00:50:50,125
[MENDESAH]

1217
00:50:51,167 --> 00:50:52,042
Hei.

1218
00:50:53,542 --> 00:50:55,083
-Ya?
-[TESS] Kamu mau pulang?

1219
00:50:57,333 --> 00:50:58,917
Aku baru aja selesai beres-beres.

1220
00:51:00,250 --> 00:51:01,583
Iya, a-aku harus cabut.

1221
00:51:07,958 --> 00:51:08,917
[PINTU TERTUTUP]

1222
00:51:10,833 --> 00:51:11,833
Gimana kabar kalian?

1223
00:51:11,917 --> 00:51:13,333
[SORAK-SORAI]

1224
00:51:13,417 --> 00:51:14,583
Oke.

1225
00:51:15,875 --> 00:51:17,333
[BERDEHEM]

1226
00:51:17,417 --> 00:51:19,792
Duh, halo. Aku Alex.

1227
00:51:19,875 --> 00:51:21,042
Gimana perasaan kalian malam ini?

1228
00:51:21,125 --> 00:51:22,125
[PENONTON BERSORAK]

1229
00:51:22,208 --> 00:51:24,208
Bagus. Aku ngerasa lumayan oke.

1230
00:51:25,083 --> 00:51:28,375
Aku, eh— baru-baru ini pisah sama istriku.

1231
00:51:28,458 --> 00:51:30,917
-[[PENONTON] AAWW]
-Enggak. Oh, makasih ya.

1232
00:51:31,000 --> 00:51:32,333
[TAWA PENONTON]

1233
00:51:32,417 --> 00:51:37,083
Dan, eh, kayaknya
dia mungkin lagi deket sama orang.

1234
00:51:37,167 --> 00:51:38,458
Iya, aku baru aja tau soal kemungkinan…

1235
00:51:38,542 --> 00:51:39,917
kalau dia lagi deket sama orang,

1236
00:51:40,000 --> 00:51:41,750
dan aku baik-baik aja kok, kayaknya.

1237
00:51:41,833 --> 00:51:44,042
-[TAWA TERPENCAR]
-Ya kan? Dan, eh…

1238
00:51:44,125 --> 00:51:46,417
Jadi aku baru aja bikin daftar, eh…

1239
00:51:46,500 --> 00:51:49,958
kemungkinan skenario terburuknya,
yang menurutku sehat banget buat mental.

1240
00:51:50,042 --> 00:51:51,458
Nomor satu.

1241
00:51:51,542 --> 00:51:54,917
Cowok ini seorang ahli radiologi.

1242
00:51:55,000 --> 00:51:59,167
Karena itu artinya dia berwawasan,

1243
00:51:59,250 --> 00:52:03,042
dia punya jiwa mulia,
dan duitnya banyak banget.

1244
00:52:03,833 --> 00:52:07,333
Parah banget. Itu nomor satu.
Nomor dua. Dia hobi surfing.

1245
00:52:07,417 --> 00:52:09,083
Karena surfing itu keren banget,

1246
00:52:09,167 --> 00:52:12,208
dan orang-orang itu kelihatannya
keren-keren banget,

1247
00:52:12,292 --> 00:52:14,500
dan mereka kayak bisa lakuin apa aja,

1248
00:52:14,583 --> 00:52:17,208
-terus mereka nyetir mobil pikap tua.
-[TAWA PENONTON]

1249
00:52:17,292 --> 00:52:19,917
Tau kan, mereka gak pedulian,
gak pernah pake alas kaki.

1250
00:52:20,500 --> 00:52:23,458
Dan, eh, gak ada tutup toples
yang gak bisa mereka buka.

1251
00:52:23,958 --> 00:52:25,375
Paham kan maksudku?

1252
00:52:25,458 --> 00:52:27,833
Dan mereka gak perlu potong
rambut, atau ngapa-ngapain.

1253
00:52:27,917 --> 00:52:30,333
Terus kulitnya selalu cokelat
terbakar matahari. Um…

1254
00:52:30,833 --> 00:52:32,833
Dan lengan mereka kelihatannya
kuat-kuat banget,

1255
00:52:32,917 --> 00:52:33,917
tau kan?

1256
00:52:34,000 --> 00:52:36,500
Yang mana, kalau dibayangin, um,

1257
00:52:36,583 --> 00:52:38,750
seseorang yang kamu sayang,
kayak wanita yang kamu sayang…

1258
00:52:38,833 --> 00:52:40,833
bareng cowok yang lengannya kuat banget.

1259
00:52:40,917 --> 00:52:42,167
[TAWA TERPENCAR]

1260
00:52:42,250 --> 00:52:46,292
Eh, lenganku sih
sebenernya udah lemes banget. Um…

1261
00:52:47,375 --> 00:52:49,958
Gak, itu gak bener. Aku sebenernya
olahraga lumayan rajin.

1262
00:52:50,875 --> 00:52:54,042
Aku punya tubuh, um,
yang aku sebut sebagai, um,

1263
00:52:54,125 --> 00:52:56,250
dan banyak wanita nyebutnya…
perut buncit ala bapak-apak.

1264
00:52:56,333 --> 00:52:59,083
[TAWA, TEPUK TANGAN]

1265
00:52:59,167 --> 00:53:02,333
Ngomong-ngomong, aku baru sadar kalau
kaum pria udah berhasil banget…

1266
00:53:02,417 --> 00:53:06,542
meyakinkan para wanita
kalau perut buncit itu hal bagus.

1267
00:53:07,208 --> 00:53:09,417
Tau kan? Kayak, kita bilang,
"Oh, dia punya perut bapak-bapak."

1268
00:53:09,500 --> 00:53:13,833
Terus kita kayak, "Oke." Kayaknya kita
semua ngumpul dan berkonspirasi.

1269
00:53:13,917 --> 00:53:15,250
Paham kan maksudku? Ya sudahlah.

1270
00:53:15,333 --> 00:53:16,542
Um…

1271
00:53:16,625 --> 00:53:20,167
Jadi, ya, gitu…
ahli radiologi, peselancar.

1272
00:53:21,500 --> 00:53:24,208
Bakal jadi mimpi buruk kalau dia itu
seorang ahli radiologi yang hobi surfing.

1273
00:53:24,292 --> 00:53:25,333
[TAWA PENONTON]

1274
00:53:25,417 --> 00:53:28,083
Karena itu bakal… itu bakal…

1275
00:53:28,917 --> 00:53:30,333
[MENDESAH]

1276
00:53:30,417 --> 00:53:33,375
[TAWA PENONTON]

1277
00:53:34,583 --> 00:53:37,833
Bakal kayak— Gimana ya, dia bakal
dateng ke rumahku…

1278
00:53:37,917 --> 00:53:41,417
pake mobil Porsche-nya
yang norak tapi bagus.

1279
00:53:41,500 --> 00:53:45,125
Um, terus ajak dia pergi
buat— buat kencan?

1280
00:53:45,208 --> 00:53:46,500
[MENGEJEK]

1281
00:53:47,333 --> 00:53:48,292
Maksudku…

1282
00:53:50,042 --> 00:53:52,250
Jill, aku mentok di sini.

1283
00:53:53,125 --> 00:53:54,458
[JILL] Lanjutin— Lanjutin aja.

1284
00:53:54,542 --> 00:53:55,958
Iya, aku gak… Oke.

1285
00:53:56,500 --> 00:53:58,000
Ini dia…

1286
00:53:58,083 --> 00:53:59,917
Apa yang aku tulis
di catatanku setelah itu ya…?

1287
00:54:00,000 --> 00:54:01,083
[JILL] Kamu tulis—

1288
00:54:01,167 --> 00:54:03,292
Apa yang aku bilang
setelah aku ajak mereka, uh…

1289
00:54:03,375 --> 00:54:04,250
Aku ajak mereka kencan?

1290
00:54:04,333 --> 00:54:05,417
