1723
01:11:22,250 --> 01:11:24,792
Dengerin ya… Dan, um…

1724
01:11:25,292 --> 01:11:28,292
Dan anehnya aku malah
kangen juga sama momen berantem kami.

1725
01:11:29,083 --> 01:11:31,500
Iya, berantemnya tuh… Berantem kami tuh…

1726
01:11:31,583 --> 01:11:33,208
Uh…

1727
01:11:33,292 --> 01:11:35,250
-…main psikologis?
-[TAWA PENONTON]

1728
01:11:35,333 --> 01:11:37,042
Paham kan maksudku?
Kalian ngerti kan arahnya ke mana?

1729
01:11:38,333 --> 01:11:40,958
-Semua cowok di sini pasti paham.
-[TAWA PENONTON]

1730
01:11:41,042 --> 01:11:42,791
Mereka pasti kayak,
"Iya. Tiap interaksi tuh

1731
01:11:42,875 --> 01:11:45,292
kayak ngelewatin
ladang ranjau psikologis."

1732
01:11:46,125 --> 01:11:47,875
Kalian tau kan pas istri
atau pasangan kalian

1733
01:11:47,958 --> 01:11:49,750
jadi diem, diem banget,

1734
01:11:49,833 --> 01:11:52,542
dan sekarang kalian harus
nebak apa yang salah?

1735
01:11:52,625 --> 01:11:56,500
Jadi, kalian harus tanya
pertanyaan pancingan yang umum.

1736
01:11:56,583 --> 01:11:58,125
Bikin senetral mungk—

1737
01:11:58,208 --> 01:12:01,333
Aku inget suatu kali, aku sama mantan
istriku lagi di mobil, perjalanan pulang

1738
01:12:01,417 --> 01:12:02,917
dari rumah temen.

1739
01:12:03,917 --> 01:12:06,292
Dan dia diem seribu bahasa.

1740
01:12:07,292 --> 01:12:09,042
Dia diem banget, kayak…

1741
01:12:09,125 --> 01:12:10,792
Kalian inget film <i>Jacob's Ladder</i>?

1742
01:12:10,875 --> 01:12:11,875
[TAWA PENONTON]

1743
