1752
01:12:34,125 --> 01:12:36,375
[TAWA PENONTON]

1753
01:12:36,458 --> 01:12:38,042
Terus dia liat aku dan dia bilang,

1754
01:12:38,125 --> 01:12:42,292
"Tau gak, kadang aku cuma
pengen kamu ngajak aku ngobrol

1755
01:12:42,375 --> 01:12:44,375
pake cara yang sama kayak
kamu ngobrol sama temen-temenmu."

1756
01:12:44,458 --> 01:12:46,125
[[PENONTON] AAWW]

1757
